KIS TARHA JEE PAUNGI MAI TUJHKO PYASA DEKHKAR<br>
AATA HAI MUH KO KALEJA QALI JHULA DEKHKAR<br>
<br>
Qaima-e-Shabbir Me Matam Bapa Hone Laga<br>
Haan Bulao Shah Ko Banu Ne Ye Rokar Kaha<br>
Che Mahine Wale ko Jhule Se Girta Dekhkar<br>
<br>
Hai Qayam-e-Shah Me Sab Pyas Se Bacche Nidhal<br>
Hai Ali Asghar Bahut Pyase Ye Sab Ko Hai Qayal<br>
Roti Hai Bali Sakeena Qali Quza Dekhkar<br>
<br>
Chehra-e-Asghar Pa Tha Jo Nusrat-e-Shahe Ka Sabab<br>
Baraha Akber Balaye Leti Umme Rabab<br>
Mut-Maeen Thi Maa Bahut Asghar Ka Chera Dekhkar<br>
<br>
Khud Ko Jhule Se Giraya Roke Ye Kheti Thi Maa<br>
Koi Baqi Ab Nahi Tanha Khade Hai Baba Jaan<br>
Kyon Mai Jhule Me Rahu Baba Ko Tanha Dekhkar<br>
<br>
Chalgayi Shamsheer Qalb-e-Hazrat-e-Shabbir Par<br>
Hurmula Ka Teer Nikla Jab Gale Ko Chedkar<br>
Ro-Pade Shabbir Asghar Ka Tadapna Dekhkar<br>
<br>
Dekhkar Lasha Ali Asghar Ka Kheti Thi Ye Maa<br>
Khoo me Dooba Aaye Ho Ran Se Palatkar Meri Jaa<br>
Kis-Tarha Zinda Rahu Mai Tera Lasha Dekhkar<br>
<br>
Mere Asghar Mere Dilbar Kheke Chillati Thi Maa<br>
Qawab Se Bedar Hokar Hath Phelati Thi Maa<br>
Qawab Me Ghutni Ke Bal Asghar Ko Aata Dekhkar<br>
<br>
Arsh Tharraya Madine Ki Zameen Hilne Lagi<br>
Sughra Ghash Se Chounkkar Sar Peetkar Rone Lagi<br>
Qawab Me Zibha Ali Asghar Ko Hota Dekhkar<br>
<br>
Dekhkar Manzar ko Ye Rone Lage Ambiya<br>
Goonjti Thi karbala Me Haye Asghar Ki Sada<br>
Lash-e-Asghar Ko Lahad Se Bahar Aata Dekhkar<br>
<br>
Har Qadam Par Banu-e-Muztar Pachade Khati Hai<br>
Dekhkar Asghar ka Sar Madar Pachade Khati Hai<br>
Rote Hai Asghar Sina Par Maa Ka Chehra Dekhker<br>
<br>
Rakte Hain Lasha Lahad Me Asghar-e-Besheer Ka<br>
Chehre Se Chadar Hatai Shahe Ne Hyder Ba-Khuda<br>
Maa Tadapkar Reh-Gayi Asghar Ka Lasha Dekhkar